  "period_note": "Year-end (31 December 2019) position from Midland Bank's own audited annual report \"MDB Financial Performance and Ratios: 5 Years Overview\", taken from the FY2021 report. SOLO / STANDALONE basis. Midland Bank was licensed in 2013, so FY2013 is the bank's first year of operation and this series covers its entire public history; there is no FY2011 or FY2012 to report. All figures are as reported by the bank; the source table prints total liabilities directly, so nothing on the balance sheet is derived. The row mapped to operating_profit is the bank's 'Profit before provision and tax' (labelled 'Profit before provision on loans and corporate tax' in some years), i.e. pre-provision operating profit. The FY2019 annual report extracts with no usable summary table (it is a scan or its embedded font defeats text extraction), so this year comes from the FY2021 report's comparative column. RESTATEMENTS -- 15 figure(s) here are reported differently by other Midland Bank annual reports; the contemporaneous value is kept and the divergence recorded: total_equity: this record uses 7038 (AR2021); AR2023 report 7078; earning_assets: this record uses 47026 (AR2021); AR2023 report 47294; net_interest_income: this record uses 1275.19 (AR2021); AR2023 report 1292.23; total_operating_income: this record uses 2310.88 (AR2021); AR2023 report 2327.92; operating_profit: this record uses 1268.52 (AR2021); AR2023 report 1285.57; profit_before_tax: this record uses 1051.35 (AR2021); AR2023 report 1088.43; profit_after_tax: this record uses 557.41 (AR2021); AR2023 report 596.59; tier1_capital: this record uses 7018 (AR2021); AR2023 report 7075; total_capital: this record uses 7527 (AR2021); AR2023 report 7587; capital_surplus_deficit: this record uses 3074 (AR2021); AR2023 report 3140; car_pct: this record uses 21.13 (AR2021); AR2023 report 21.33; npl_pct: this record uses 2.64 (AR2021); AR2023 report 1.79; provision_classified: this record uses 286 (AR2021); AR2023 report 2